{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_36","type":"agent_message","text":"The expanded tests passed emulated controller input, simultaneous touch input, audio signal checks, two-page BroadcastChannel and WebRTC links, and all three official AI Hub harness scenarios, including packet loss and host departure. Visual review caught reversed face winding on the craft, which is fixed. I’m finishing the attract-mode edge cases and adjusting the tow camera to keep the walker and skimmer together on screen."}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_37","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > src/mission.js <<'EOF'\n// Designer-editable sortie data. Positions use metres on the X/Z snowfield.\nexport const DEFAULTS={speed:32,turn:1.8,laserDamage:1,enemyDamage:1,pressure:1,wraps:2,timeScale:1};\nexport const settingsDefault={music:.1,sfx:.7,voice:.55,glyphs:'ps',camera:'chase',aimAssist:true,shake:true,sensitivity:1};\nexport const MISSION={\n walkers:[[-36,-42],[67,-114]],\n scouts:[[0,-45],[-73,-75],[76,-140]],\n repairs:[[-72,53],[94,-8],[-91,-166],[48,-216]],\n escortRaiders:[[-65,62],[75,-28],[-75,-130]],\n chapters:[\n  {title:'THE COLD OPEN',objective:'CLEAR THE APPROACH',voice:'ROOK / FLIGHT LEAD',briefing:'Three scouts on the approach. Take them out before they find the refuge.'},\n  {title:'BIG FEET. SMALL PROBLEM.',objective:'TANGLE THE TITANS',voice:'ROOK / FLIGHT LEAD',briefing:'The walkers are moving. Guns will barely scratch them. Get close and wrap their legs.'},\n  {title:'THE LAST TRANSPORT',objective:'BRING THEM HOME',voice:'CONTROL / REFUGE',briefing:'Ark is lifting with thirty-eight aboard. Stay close and keep that corridor clear.'}\n ]\n};\nEOF\npython3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('src/game.js');s=p.read_text()\ns=s.replace(\\\"import {Interface} from './ui.js';\\\",\\\"import {Interface} from './ui.js';\\\\nimport {DEFAULTS,settingsDefault,MISSION} from './mission.js';\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"const DEFAULTS={speed:32,turn:1.8,laserDamage:1,enemyDamage:1,pressure:1,wraps:2,timeScale:1};\\\\nconst settingsDefault={music:.1,sfx:.7,voice:.55,glyphs:'ps',camera:'chase',aimAssist:true,shake:true,sensitivity:1};\\\\n\\\",'')\ns=s.replace(\\\"this.completed=false;this.ended=false;this.escortStarted\\\", \\\"this.completed=false;this.won=false;this.ended=false;this.escortStarted\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"if(this.noteInput('keyboard'))return;this.sound.unlock();if(this.ignoreInputUntil\\\", \\\"if(this.noteInput('keyboard')){e.pre